{start_of_outro}
That lucky [F#m]ciga-rette, layin' [D]on our backs
We were [A]out of breath, we both [E]took a drag
Blew it [F#m]in the sky, she was [D]gone like that
One hell [A]of a night, one hell [E]of a pack
